{
  "title": "ISic001885. Funerary inscription for a young woman",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"la\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>[d(is)] m(anibus) ❦ s(acrum) <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"nta · Fla\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"nta\"><span data-text=\"nta\">nta</span></span> · <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Fla\"><span data-text=\"Fla\">Fla</span></span></span>-<br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] · vixit · <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>[an]nis · XVIII <br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>[p]ạter fecit </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"la\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>[..]M❦S<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"nta · Fla\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"nta\"><span data-text=\"nta\">NTA</span></span>·<span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Fla\"><span data-text=\"Fla\">FLA</span></span></span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]·VIXIT·<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>[..]NIS·XVIII<br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>[.].TERFECIT</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic001885_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2024-09-28\" src=\"ISic001885_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic001885.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2024-09-28\" src=\"ISic001885-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text from autopsy/photograph</span></span>; </li><li><span class=\"5\">5: <span>Alternatively: [m]ater; the serif of the foot of the initial A is just visible.</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>Italian translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>Sacro agli dei Mani. [---]nta Fla[---] visse 18 anni. Il padre (o la madre) fece.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>Sacred to the shades of the underworld. [---]nta Fla[---] lived 18 years. Her father (or mother) made it.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The first, fourth and fifth lines indicate that only 2-3 letters are missing on the left side, suggesting a pair of names such as Quinta Flavia (but many other names such as Amynta, Inventa, Leonta, etc. are also possible).</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li></li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"><p>Neatly carved, regular v-cut letters, of a medium wwidth module and with pronounced wedge serifs.</p> Line 1-5    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
